  "body": "So far I've looked at the code [for Gecko](https://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/rev/88199de427d3c5762b7f3c2a4860c10734abd867/dom/html/HTMLImageElement.cpp#1244-1296), and [for Blink](https://cs.chromium.org/chromium/src/third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/html_image_element.cc?l=308-346&rcl=1a2fc71a8fb505f32af238ad7d36c671dec6a18d) and have found no trace of step 3 of the [update the source set](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/images.html#update-the-source-set) algorithm. There are also no tests that I can find that include width attributes for the responsive images from the set in [this directory](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/tree/master/html/semantics/embedded-content/the-img-element). This makes me nervous when trying to implement the spec in Servo from scratch.",
